    "final_text": "The cluster appears healthy based on the snapshot provided. Here's the health overview:\n\n### Nodes\n- All nodes are functioning correctly. No issues reported.\n\n### Namespaces\n- **default**: Contains the `api-app` pod, which is running normally.\n- **ingress-nginx**: Contains the `ingress-nginx-controller` pod, which is running normally.\n- **kube-system**: All system pods (e.g., `coredns`, `etcd`, `kube-apiserver`, etc.) are running normally.\n- **local-path-storage**: Contains the `local-path-provisioner` pod, which is running normally.\n- **mohsen**: Contains `fancy-website` and `web-app` pods, both running normally.\n- **monitoring**: All monitoring-related pods (e.g., Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, etc.) are running normally.\n\n### Problems\n- No warning events are present in the cluster.\n- All pods are in the `Running` or `Completed` state, with no issues like `CrashLoopBackOff`, `ImagePullBackOff`, or `Pending`.\n\n### Summary\nThe cluster is healthy, with no active issues or warnings. All namespaces and pods are functioning as expected.",
